  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197492",
      "title": "Starting Work on the Game Screen",
      "lectureOrder": 60,
      "videoOrder": 57,
      "sourceHash": "faee4ec442335db967f1bdf89a744dfd8fc159c9a605fd090bdbf7a858d44568",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 3.41,
          "en": "So let's start working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.41,
          "end": 5.37,
          "en": "on this game screen now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.37,
          "end": 8.72,
          "en": "And we got a couple of things that should be added there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.72,
          "end": 11.53,
          "en": "For example, the main thing that's happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.53,
          "end": 14.49,
          "en": "on this screen is that our phone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.49,
          "end": 18.929,
          "en": "so the program in the end, the app, is guessing a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.929,
          "end": 21.68,
          "en": "and then we have controls to tell the program",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.68,
          "end": 25.14,
          "en": "if the number is too high or too low.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.14,
          "end": 28.19,
          "en": "Therefore, we definitely need to output the guessed number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.19,
          "end": 32.95,
          "en": "and we need to derive the guessed number as a first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.95,
          "end": 35.08,
          "en": "Then we need to output the controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.08,
          "end": 38.24,
          "en": "that allow us to provide feedback to the program",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.24,
          "end": 40.76,
          "en": "and then we need to recalculate a new number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.76,
          "end": 42.89,
          "en": "based on that feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.89,
          "end": 46.02,
          "en": "In addition, I wanna log all the rounds we had in the game,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.02,
          "end": 49.6,
          "en": "so I wanna log the different guesses that have been made.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.6,
          "end": 51.331,
          "en": "Therefore, here in the game screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.331,
          "end": 53.95,
          "en": "we will definitely need a view to group",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.95,
          "end": 56.373,
          "en": "all these different UI elements that we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.65,
          "end": 59.52,
          "en": "So we'll have this main view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.52,
          "end": 62.411,
          "en": "and then in there, I wanna have a text where I say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.411,
          "end": 67.31,
          "en": "opponent's guess, this is just a title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.31,
          "end": 69.66,
          "en": "but I want to have this kind of title here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.66,
          "end": 73.16,
          "en": "then below that, I want to have the actual guess",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.16,
          "end": 77.36,
          "en": "being output and yes, we can't add text like this in a view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.36,
          "end": 79.1,
          "en": "but this is just a placeholder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.1,
          "end": 80.72,
          "en": "We'll add a nice component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.72,
          "end": 84.36,
          "en": "that shows the guess by the opponent here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 87.06,
          "en": "And then below that I wanna have another view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.06,
          "end": 91.25,
          "en": "which holds the controls that we have to tell the opponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.25,
          "end": 95.203,
          "en": "the program, whether the guess was too high or too low.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.16,
          "end": 98.2,
          "en": "So here we could have another text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.2,
          "end": 102.00999999999999,
          "en": "where we say higher or lower",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.00999999999999,
          "end": 105.19,
          "en": "and then below that we have our two buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.19,
          "end": 107.87,
          "en": "where we basically show a plus or minus",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.87,
          "end": 110.5,
          "en": "to indicate whether it's too low or to high.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.5,
          "end": 112.42,
          "en": "These are all the chess placeholders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.42,
          "end": 114.513,
          "en": "we'll add real buttons instead soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.68,
          "end": 117.34,
          "en": "And then below all of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.34,
          "end": 121.503,
          "en": "we'll have another view where we log our rounds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.04,
          "end": 124.72,
          "en": "So that's the general structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.72,
          "end": 127.6,
          "en": "with plenty of placeholders that we have here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.6,
          "end": 131.15,
          "en": "and we'll have to fill those placeholders step by step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.15,
          "end": 135.14,
          "en": "and we'll have to style this overall screen step by step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.14,
          "end": 138.96,
          "en": "And I'll start by styling this view that wraps everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.96,
          "end": 141.64,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that we don't have the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.64,
          "end": 143.62,
          "en": "crammed up to the edges here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.62,
          "end": 146.23,
          "en": "instead, it should be centered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.23,
          "end": 149.46,
          "en": "it should be clearly visible on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.46,
          "end": 152.82,
          "en": "And of course for that, we can use good old Flexbox.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.82,
          "end": 156.15,
          "en": "So we'll add a style sheet here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 158.63,
          "en": "in this game screen component, as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.63,
          "end": 160.99,
          "en": "and create the styles constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.36,
          "end": 165.81,
          "en": "which then will hold a style sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.81,
          "end": 169.23,
          "en": "that is created with the create method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.49,
          "end": 172.44,
          "en": "and then here in this style sheet object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.44,
          "end": 174.69,
          "en": "I'll add a property named screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.69,
          "end": 177.17000000000002,
          "en": "Name as always, is up to you though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.17000000000002,
          "end": 180.23,
          "en": "which gets flex one to make sure it takes up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.23,
          "end": 181.73,
          "en": "all the available space,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.73,
          "end": 183.68,
          "en": "instead of just the space needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.68,
          "end": 188.58,
          "en": "by the content of the element that receives this property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.58,
          "end": 191.74,
          "en": "We wanna take all the available space instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.74,
          "end": 195.38,
          "en": "And I'll already add some padding, let's say, 12 pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.38,
          "end": 199.14,
          "en": "to make sure that we add some distance in all directions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.14,
          "end": 202.193,
          "en": "so that we have some distance to the device edges.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 203.48,
          "end": 204.77,
          "en": "Now for the moment, that's it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.77,
          "end": 206.66,
          "en": "For a start, that's good enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.66,
          "end": 209.88,
          "en": "And then I'll add this style to this view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.88,
          "end": 212.543,
          "en": "as we did it many times before, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.91,
          "end": 218.07,
          "en": "If we save this, I get an error, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.07,
          "end": 221.82,
          "en": "because I have these texts here which must go into texts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 221.82,
          "end": 224.87,
          "en": "and I'll just comment those placeholders out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.87,
          "end": 227.53,
          "en": "because they are just meant to be used as placeholders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.53,
          "end": 229.47,
          "en": "not as actual text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.47,
          "end": 232.01,
          "en": "I also have this text, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.01,
          "end": 233.72,
          "en": "Let's count this out, as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.72,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "Now with that finally, if I go to this screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 238.53,
          "en": "we have this extra content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.53,
          "end": 242.75,
          "en": "but it's actually still in the top left corner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 242.75,
          "end": 245.67,
          "en": "Now actually, there is some padding here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 245.67,
          "end": 248.98,
          "en": "as you can tell if I ramp up the padding to 40,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.98,
          "end": 253.693,
          "en": "now it's moved in further, but 12 pixels wasn't enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.95,
          "end": 256.41,
          "en": "Now we didn't have the problem here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 256.41,
          "end": 258.33,
          "en": "on the start game screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 258.33,
          "end": 260.84,
          "en": "because on this screen, we do add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.84,
          "end": 263.68,
          "en": "quite a lot of margin to the top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.68,
          "end": 267.3,
          "en": "We could add this here, as well on this game screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 267.3,
          "end": 270.83,
          "en": "but actually I want to introduce a new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 270.83,
          "end": 275.19,
          "en": "that is very useful when it comes to adding some distance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 275.19,
          "end": 278.87,
          "en": "to the device edges, especially to the top of the device,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 278.87,
          "end": 281.22,
          "en": "to the notch as we have it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.22,
          "end": 283.323,
          "en": "And that's the safe area view.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
